{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "afac5b36-3acb-8ae6-b37b-1dc3bb84e681",
  "created_at": "2026-02-24T11:56:25-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Beatriz Rivera",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T11:52:32-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T11:52:37-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi Kevin, this is Beatriz Rivera. I'm calling about the water out back of my building. It's wicked bad every time we get a storm, and we just had that nor'easter, Saturday into Sunday."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T11:52:50-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, yeah, that was a big one. Where are you located, Ms. Rivera?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T11:52:56-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "361 Bliss Road, on the Easton's Beach side. The parking lot behind the building slopes right toward the back door, so all the water runs down and sits at the entrance. Sunday morning it was up over the threshold mat."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T11:53:11-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. So the lot out back drains toward the door and floods the entrance. Let me write that down. Is it the lot's own drain that's not taking it, or is it more the way it's pitched?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T11:53:25-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Honestly, the pitch. It goes the wrong way. But there's also a manhole cover out there that looks off by an inch. It's sitting higher on one side, like it didn't get set back right. I don't know if that's part of it, but somebody's going to trip or catch a tire on it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T11:53:45-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, manhole cover sitting about an inch off. Is that in the lot itself or out on the street?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T11:53:53-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "In the lot, near the back corner. Closer to the street than the door, though."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T11:53:59-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. Noting that. And has this happened before, with the water at the door?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T11:54:05-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, every big rain. Every one. I've lived in Newport my whole life and this lot has always been a mess, but it's gotten worse. I'm tired of mopping the entry and nobody doing anything about it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T11:54:19-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I hear you. Let me ask, do you know if the lot is city property or private? Sometimes that changes who handles the grading."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T11:54:28-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I believe the lot goes with the building, but the manhole is the city's, isn't it? That's a sewer or drain cover, not ours."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T11:54:37-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Could be. I can't say for sure from here, so I'll have the crew look at the cover and at how the water's moving through there. That part I can send out."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T11:54:49-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. So will you open a work order? And what date is it going to be? I'd like a date, not just a maybe."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T11:54:58-05:00",
      "duration": 21,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, I'll open the work order right now for the manhole cover and the drainage at the back of 361 Bliss Road. As for the date, I don't get to set that. The crews are still working through calls from the storm, so it'll go in the queue. I can put a note asking for an inspection this week."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T11:55:19-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "This week. Alright. I'll believe it when I see the truck. [pause] Sorry, I'm not mad at you, Kevin. It's just, I went by the farm stand in Middletown to pick up some squash on Saturday and they were closed for the season, and then this on top of it. Not my week."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T11:55:38-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that's fair. Those stands shut down right when you want them. Let me get a callback number so someone can reach you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T11:55:47-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's 401-555-0161."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T11:55:49-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0161. And the work order will be for 361 Bliss Road, water pooling at the back entrance, manhole cover about an inch off in the rear lot. Did I get that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T11:56:01-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's it. And put that it floods the door, not just puddles. It comes right in."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T11:56:08-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Will do. Flooding at the back door. I'll note that you asked for a date, and if I hear anything on scheduling, someone will call you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T11:56:18-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Thank you, Kevin. I'll be watching for that call."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T11:56:22-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You got it, Ms. Rivera. Take care."
    }
  ],
